# GitHub's language bar counts what people write, not what a tool generates. The files below are
# generated, so they are marked and left out of the statistics (and the diffs of generated files
# are collapsed by default on GitHub). Added on 24 October 2026 with the TypeScript move, on
# MoonApp's .gitattributes.
#
# script.js is compiled from ts/script.ts by tools/build-ts.sh; edit the TypeScript.
/script.js linguist-generated=true
# The test corpora for the Android port and the command line, each written from the compiled
# script.js by the tools/ generator of the same name (tools/gen-strength-golden.ts and
# tools/gen-sanitise-golden.ts); tools/check-strength-parity.py holds them to it.
/android/app/src/test/resources/strength-golden.tsv linguist-generated=true
/android/app/src/test/resources/sanitise-golden.csv linguist-generated=true
# The exact entropy of every language mode, written from the word lists by tools/gen-entropy-model.py.
/data/entropy-model.tsv linguist-generated=true
# The page vectors, captured by tests/capture-vectors.ts from the 12ddca5 page (the last hand-written
# script.js) and replayed by tests/smoke.ts against the current page; the file's capturedFrom field
# names its source.
/tests/page-vectors.json linguist-generated=true
